EXPERIMENT 10: STYLEHUB FASHION SHOPPING SYSTEM
1. AIM
To design and develop an online fashion shopping website using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript that allows users to browse clothing products, search and filter items, add products to a shopping cart, manage quantities, calculate the total price, and place an order.
2. ALGORITHM
1. Start the program.
2. Create a webpage to display fashion products.
3. Design the webpage using HTML and CSS.
4. Display clothing items with names, images, sizes, and prices.
5. Provide search and category filtering options.
6. Allow users to add products to the shopping cart.
7. Allow users to increase, decrease, or remove cart items.
8. Calculate the subtotal and delivery charges dynamically.
9. Display the order summary after checkout.
10. Stop the program.
